# Build scaffolding, kept locally. These are step-by-step instructions written
# for the agent that implemented each phase -- they depend on a private tooling
# plugin the reader cannot run, they restate code that now lives in src/, and
# they go stale the moment that code changes. The design document they were
# derived from is published under docs/design/ instead.
docs/superpowers/
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md

